{
  "info": {
    "name": "SCRUM-203 School assignment and school score v2",
    "description": "School assignment and school score v2 (docs/school-score-v2.md). Both are background jobs of the ingestion job framework (job type SCHOOL_SCORING): assign gives every property with a parcel its zoned school per level (or the nearest zoned public school) and then computes its school score v2; calculate-all?version=2 recomputes the score only. Only changed rows are written.\n\nSetup: migrations V42, V44 and V49 applied; the SCRUM-202 school data loaded; the app started with INGESTION_JOBS_ENABLED=true. access_token must have the admin realm role; user_token is any token without it (folder 4). Run folder 1 in order and send each job status request until COMPLETED (a first assignment of Miami-Dade takes several minutes, a repeated one about 4). zonedProperty, nearestProperty, ungradedProperty and unmatchedProperty (in the Shadowlawn zone, whose school is not in the school data) are Miami-Dade property IDs of the local rehearsal; replace them with IDs of your database (queries in the docs). No secret is stored in this file.\n\nThe jobs are admin operations on reference data shared by every property, so the ownership checks of the ticket template do not apply; the role checks are in folder 4 and the input checks in folder 3. The other 409 answers (migration V49 missing, a county without zones or without assignments) need a database in that state and are covered by IngestionLaunchServiceImplTest.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "user_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "fips5",
      "value": "12086"
    },
    {
      "key": "zonedProperty",
      "value": "556"
    },
    {
      "key": "nearestProperty",
      "value": "45472"
    },
    {
      "key": "ungradedProperty",
      "value": "130222"
    },
    {
      "key": "unmatchedProperty",
      "value": "205322"
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 Jobs (success)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Assign the county, then score it",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 queued', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const job = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('school scoring job', () => { pm.expect(job.jobType).to.eql('SCHOOL_SCORING'); pm.expect(job.dataset).to.eql('SCHOOL_ASSIGNMENT'); pm.expect(job.status).to.be.oneOf(['QUEUED', 'RUNNING']); pm.expect(job.inputStorage).to.eql('NONE'); });",
                  "pm.test('Location points at the job', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.eql('/api/ingestion/jobs/' + job.id));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('jobId', job.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/property-school-analysis/assign?fips5={{fips5}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "property-school-analysis",
                "assign"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "fips5",
                  "value": "{{fips5}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Assign again while that job runs (409, nothing queued)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
                  "pm.test('says why', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include(\"DATASET_JOB_ACTIVE\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/property-school-analysis/assign?fips5={{fips5}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "property-school-analysis",
                "assign"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "fips5",
                  "value": "{{fips5}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Job status (poll until COMPLETED)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const job = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('counters add up', () => pm.expect(job.processed).to.eql(job.completed + job.skipped + job.failed));",
                  "if (job.status === 'COMPLETED') {",
                  "  pm.test('every property handled, none failed', () => { pm.expect(job.processed).to.eql(job.total); pm.expect(job.failed).to.eql(0); pm.expect(job.total).to.be.above(0); });",
                  "  pm.test('step reports the rows per level and method, then the scored properties', () => { pm.expect(job.currentStep).to.include('(zone/unmatched/nearest)'); pm.expect(job.currentStep).to.include('scored'); });",
                  "} else { pm.test('job still running or queued', () => pm.expect(job.status).to.be.oneOf(['QUEUED', 'RUNNING'])); console.log('job is ' + job.status + ', send again'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/jobs/{{jobId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "ingestion",
                "jobs",
                "{{jobId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Score v2 again (after a new FLDOE grades load)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
